WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.750
This dossier examines the Phoenix Pay System.

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:11.112
What began as a 309 million dollar payroll upgrade has become a 9.3 billion dollar catastrophe.

00:00:11.112 --> 00:00:14.625
5.1 billion wasted on failures.

00:00:14.625 --> 00:00:18.575
4.2 billion more to replace it with Dayforce.

00:00:18.575 --> 00:00:22.762
216,000 transactions still backlogged.

00:00:22.762 --> 00:00:25.775
Won't be fixed until 2031.
